WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:03,010
boss

2
00:00:03,010 --> 00:00:05,010
Please help me contact lawyers and shareholders to investigate this matter

3
00:00:05,010 --> 00:00:07,010
I will provide all the evidence

4
00:00:07,010 --> 00:00:10,480
Will also cooperate according to procedures

5
00:00:10,480 --> 00:00:12,480
The legitimate rights and interests of employees’ family members are infringed upon

6
00:00:12,480 --> 00:00:14,480
The company can provide legal assistance

7
00:00:14,480 --> 00:00:16,480
Check first and then hold accountable

8
00:00:16,480 --> 00:00:18,480
No one can evade investigation by relying on their identity

9
00:00:18,480 --> 00:00:19,480
Thank you boss

10
00:00:19,480 --> 00:00:20,480
I must submit all the materials

11
00:00:20,480 --> 00:00:21,480
Don't cause trouble to the company

12
00:00:21,480 --> 00:00:22,480
I'll contact a lawyer first to preserve evidence.

13
00:00:22,480 --> 00:00:24,480
Don't talk about it in public

14
00:00:24,480 --> 00:00:42,930
If you don't want to be a cleaner, get out

15
00:00:42,930 --> 00:00:45,020
I can't even hold a plate steady.

16
00:00:45,020 --> 00:00:46,020
what else are you doing

17
00:00:46,020 --> 00:00:47,060
Where did I go wrong

18
00:00:47,060 --> 00:00:48,060
You obviously did it on purpose
